# Build context uploaded to the platform's remote builder. COPY in the
# Dockerfile is explicit, so nothing here is copied into the image -- but the
# whole context is still uploaded, and that includes .env. Keeping it out means
# the API keys never leave this machine on the way to a build server. Render
# says as much: it copies secret files into the build context root and asks you
# to exclude them here.
.git
.env
.env.*
.netlify
.venv
**/__pycache__
*.pyc
node_modules
tests
